---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-[#07090e] border-t border-white/[0.06] py-14 text-slate-400 text-sm">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 pb-12 border-b border-white/[0.05]">
      <!-- Brand -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 space-y-3">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-slate-900 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"></path>
              <path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"></path>
              <path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
            Clearinfra
          </span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 max-w-sm leading-relaxed">
          Building physics, thermal &amp; daylight engineering, and code compliance consulting—powered by our proprietary computational simulation engine.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Navigation -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3 space-y-2.5">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-300 block">Practice</span>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400">
          <li><a href="#services" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Advisory Services</a></li>
          <li><a href="#engine" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Proprietary Engine</a></li>
          <li><a href="#interactive-demo" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Live Simulation Study</a></li>
          <li><a href="#workflow" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">How We Work</a></li>
          <li><a href="#contact" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Discuss a Project</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Standards Reference -->
      <div class="md:col-span-4 space-y-2.5">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-300 block">Codes &amp; Standards</span>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
          <li>National Building Code of India (NBC 2016 Part 8)</li>
          <li>Energy Conservation Building Code (ECBC 2017)</li>
          <li>IGBC, GRIHA &amp; LEED Compliance Pathways</li>
          <li>ISO 13790 &amp; ASHRAE Psychrometrics</li>
          <li>EnergyPlus v25.1 Simulation Submittals</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 gap-4">
      <div>
        &copy; {currentYear} Clearinfra. All rights reserved.
      </div>
      <div class="font-mono">
        <a href="mailto:contact@clearinfra.in" class="hover:text-slate-300 transition-colors">contact@clearinfra.in</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
